   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85360-142.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0147_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ʾwhrmẕdʾp̄zwṭˈ nwk-lwcˈ
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>Y ŠNṬ $X-III-II lʾd MN
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>kwṭkʾn KḤDH ywdṭˈ MN
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>ẔK Y ʿL gʾlyk Y
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>PWN nmywl ṭkˈ plmwṭ
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>krṭnˈ GBʾ ṬWḆ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>hwlṭk pnyl-II W PRG
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>mnˈ gwcˈ III-II-C ḤS-X
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>dwlkˈ ʿL plsṭʾl Y
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>LʿYNˈ ʾMYṭl Y
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trl-p1-l11"/>yẕdʾnpnʾh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trl-p1-l12"/>YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trl-p1-l13"/>ʾwsṭʾndʾl
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trl-p1-l14"/>ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0147_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Ōhrmazdabzūd nōg-rōz
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>ī sāl 35 rāy az
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>kōdagān hā̆mist ǰud az
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>ān ī ō gālīg ī
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>pad Namēwar tag framūd
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>kardan paymānag did
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>xwurdag panīr 2 ud nēm
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>man gōz 500 may 10
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>dōlag ō paristār ī
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>pēš mādar ī
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trc-p1-l11"/>Yazdānpanāh
               <lb n="12" xml:id="trc-p1-l12"/>dād čak
               <lb n="13" xml:id="trc-p1-l13"/>ōstāndār
               <lb n="14" xml:id="trc-p1-l14"/>āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0147_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Ōhrmazdabzūd ordered (framūd, line 5), on behalf of (rāy, line 2) New Yearˈs day of 
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>the year 35, from
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>the young, all except 
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>those who belong to the *household 
               <lb n="5-9" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-9"/>of Namēwar, to organize a running, the quota (paymānag) again is 2 and a half man of *cottage cheese*, 500 nuts, 10 dōlag of wine to the maidservant 
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>of the mother of 
               <lb n="11" xml:id="trans-p1-l11"/>Yazdānpanāh 
               <lb n="12-14" xml:id="trans-p1-l12-14"/>to be given personally. The Ōstāndār sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>